{"id":"665419","name":"番茄鸡蛋肉沫","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665419/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"适量肉沫提前绞碎备用。","img":"images/665419/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665419/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"番茄去皮洗净切片。","img":"images/665419/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油倒入蛋液。","img":"images/665419/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎至金黄后盛出。","img":"images/665419/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫炒香。","img":"images/665419/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量生抽，蚝油炒入味。","img":"images/665419/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入番茄翻炒。","img":"images/665419/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量盐调味炒出茄汁。","img":"images/665419/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入煎过的鸡蛋。","img":"images/665419/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/665419/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开焖两三分钟左右即可出锅。","img":"images/665419/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665419/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665419/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665419/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}